For example how to use the stability/trim function, based on my T/W constraint, I chose for my stability/trim:

  Wing area: 8.2000

  Horizontal tail volume coefficient: 0.6300

  Vertical tail volume coefficient: 0.0360

  Cockpit radius: 0.6300

  Fuselage radius near tail: 0.3000

  Aspect Ratio Horizontal Stabilizer: 4

  Aspect Ratio Vertical Stabilizer: 1.8000

  Taper Ratio: 0.5000

  tail efficiency: 0.9000
  
  The tail efficiency tells the program of how well the horizontal stabilizer produce those forces when being compared to the 
  
  reference of the air flow. Highera the number between 0 to 1, the better the stability because of how well the horizontal 
  
  tail helps the pitching moment and the neutral point.

